      "slug": "index",
      "title": "Welcome",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Welcome Office Hours We are available by telephone at 415-476-8280 and in person at MU-200W. Our hours are 8 a.m",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <div>\n<div> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/g/files/tkssra11031/files/styles/cke_media_resize_xl/public/Welcome.jpg.webp?itok=EptVl0dS\" width=\"1200\" height=\"351\" alt=\"Welcome Banner\" title=\"Welcome\"> </div> </div> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Welcome</h1><h2>Office Hours</h2><p>We are available by telephone at 415-476-8280 and in person at MU-200W. Our hours are 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. Monday through Friday.&nbsp;We look forward to serving you.</p><h2>Summer Registration</h2><p>Summer 2026 registration began on April 27, 2026. Read about the <a href=\"/registration/summer-2026-registration\">important deadlines</a>.</p><h2>IRS Form 1098-T</h2><p>Your IRS <a href=\"https://registrar.ucsf.edu/registration/form-1098-t\">Form 1098-T</a>, Tuition Statement, for tax year 2025 is available.&nbsp;Please read <a href=\"https://registrar.ucsf.edu/accessing-your-form-1098-t\">how to access your Form 1098-T</a>.</p><h2>Student Portal Access for Alumni and Former Students</h2><p>Alumni and former students whose UCSF student record includes their Gmail account can use their Google credentials to log in to the student portal.&nbsp;If you do not have a Gmail account in your student record, or if you need to update the telephone number that you encounter during the login process, please <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9be9fefcf2e8efe9fae9dbeef8e8fdb5feffeea4e8eef9f1fef8efa6daf7eef6f5f2bea9abc8efeefffef5efbea9abcbf4e9effaf7bea9abdaf8f8fee8e8\">contact the Office of the Registrar</a>.&nbsp;Read more about the <a href=\"/student-records/alumni-portal-access\">Google login process</a>.</p><h2>Self-Service Enrollment Verification Available for Students</h2><p>Current students can produce an enrollment verification in the student portal.&nbsp;Access this function under the “Study List &amp; Grades” tab.&nbsp; Self-service enrollment verifications are free of charge.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div><p>&nbsp;</p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div><a href=\"https://sos.ca.gov/elections/voting-resources/voting-california\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/g/files/tkssra11031/files/styles/large/public/register-to-vote-no-border-200.png.webp?itok=WIRSirmL\" width=\"190\" height=\"57\" alt=\"Register to Vote\" title=\"Register to Vote\"> </div> </a></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
