    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/registration/spring-2026-registration",
      "path": "/registration/spring-2026-registration",
      "slug": "registration-spring-2026-registration",
      "title": "Spring 2026 Registration",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Spring 2026 Registration The Office of the Registrar welcomes students to spring 2026 registration. Please check the \"Summary\" tab in the student portal for your course enrollment (study list filing) requirement and deadline",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>\n</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Spring 2026 Registration</h1><p>The Office of the Registrar welcomes students to spring 2026 registration.</p><p>Please check the \"Summary\" tab in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\">student portal</a> for your course enrollment (study list filing) requirement and deadline. Some deadlines are as early as February 27, 2026. Study list filing is open from February 9, 2026, to April 17, 2026. You will not be able to enroll in courses if you have a hold on your registration. Please work directly with the office that placed your hold to clear the hold promptly. Your registration may be cancelled if you do not enroll in courses by the deadline.</p><p>Some or all instruction for all or part of the academic year may be delivered remotely.&nbsp;Tuition and fees have been set regardless of the method of instruction and will not be refunded in the event instruction occurs remotely for any part of the academic year.&nbsp;Figures for tuition and fees represent currently approved or proposed amounts and may not be final.&nbsp;Actual tuition and fees are subject to change by the University of California as determined to be necessary or appropriate.&nbsp;Final approved tuition and fee levels may differ from the amounts presented.</p><table><caption>Payment Deadlines</caption><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\">Program</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Healthcare Administration &amp; Interprofessional Leadership</td><td>March 26, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>ALL OTHER PROGRAMS</td><td>April 6, 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Note: Your fee payment deadline appears on the “Summary” tab and “Fees” tab in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\">student portal</a>.</p><p>Our payment drop box is located in MU-200W.</p><p>Please review our <a href=\"/paying-fees\">payment instructions</a> and <a href=\"/registration/deadlines\">deadlines</a>.</p><p><a href=\"/registration/how-register/ms-hail\">Special registration procedures</a> apply to students in the MS-HAIL program.</p></div> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Registration</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-2026-registration\">Summer 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/spring-2026-registration\" aria-current=\"page\">Spring 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/how-register\">How To Register</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/paying-fees\">Paying Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/study-list-filing\">Study List Filing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/change-study-list\">Changes To Study List</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/residency\">California Residency</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/withdrawal\">Withdrawal &amp; Leave of Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/refunds\">Refunds</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/readmission\">Readmission After Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/id-cards\">ID Cards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/intercampus-exchange\">Intercampus Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/sf-consortium\">SF Consortium</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/stanford-exchange\">Stanford Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/reduced-fee-enrollment\">Reduced Fee Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/part-time-enrollment\">Part-time Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-session-info\">Summer Session Information</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
