      "title": "Part-time Enrollment",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Part-time Enrollment At UCSF, all certificate and degree programs are full time. The dean of Graduate Education and Postdoctoral Affairs or a designated representative may approve part-time enrollment for graduate academic students, with th",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Part-time Enrollment</h1><p>At UCSF, all certificate and degree programs are full time.</p><p>The dean of <a href=\"http://graduate.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">Graduate Education and Postdoctoral Affairs</a> or a designated representative may approve part-time enrollment for graduate academic students, with the accompanying fee reductions, only for reasons of occupation, family responsibilities, or health.</p><p>Part-time students pay the full Students Services Fee, one half of the Tuition charge, and one half of any Professional Degree Supplemental Tuition. Nonresident part-time students pay one half of the Nonresident Supplemental Tuition charge.</p><p>To initiate reduction in fees, an approved application for part-time enrollment must be filed with the Office of the Registrar by the published deadline and before paying fees. The maximum number of units is six per quarter.</p><p>The <a href=\"/document/part-time-enrollment\" title=\"Part-Time Enrollment\">Petition for Part-Time Enrollment</a> is valid for a maximum of three academic quarters, starting in fall..</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Registration</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-2026-registration\">Summer 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/spring-2026-registration\">Spring 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/how-register\">How To Register</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/paying-fees\">Paying Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/study-list-filing\">Study List Filing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/change-study-list\">Changes To Study List</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/residency\">California Residency</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/withdrawal\">Withdrawal &amp; Leave of Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/refunds\">Refunds</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/readmission\">Readmission After Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/id-cards\">ID Cards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/intercampus-exchange\">Intercampus Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/sf-consortium\">SF Consortium</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/stanford-exchange\">Stanford Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/reduced-fee-enrollment\">Reduced Fee Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/part-time-enrollment\" aria-current=\"page\">Part-time Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-session-info\">Summer Session Information</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
