    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/transcripts/transcripts-fees",
      "path": "/transcripts/transcripts-fees",
      "slug": "transcripts-transcripts-fees",
      "title": "Fees for Transcripts",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Fees for Transcripts Fees for transcript services appear below. The total fee for a transcript order is the sum of the fees for the service , the processing time , and the delivery method ",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1><span>Fees for Transcripts</span></h1> <p><span>Fees for transcript services appear below. The total fee for a transcript order is the sum of the fees for the <strong>service</strong>, the <strong>processing time</strong>, and the <strong>delivery method</strong>. </span></p> <p><strong>Note: Please do not submit credit card numbers by e-mail.</strong></p> <table> <caption>Official Transcript Service Fee</caption> <thead> <tr> <th colspan=\"2\">Service</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Official Transcript</td> <td> <div>$15</div> </td> </tr> </tbody>\n</table> <table> <caption>Processing Time Fee</caption> <thead> <tr> <th colspan=\"2\">Processing Time</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Standard — normally 4 business days</td> <td> <div>$0</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td>Rush — by 4 PM next business day<br> <em>rush fee is per address</em></td> <td> <div>$25</div> </td> </tr> </tbody>\n</table> <table> <caption>Delivery Method Fee</caption> <thead> <tr> <th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\">Delivery Method</th> </tr> <tr> <th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\">Standard</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>First-Class Mail or International Airmail</td> <td> <div>$0</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td>Fax</td> <td>$0</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Fax plus First-Class Mail</td> <td>$5</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Pick up at Office of the Registrar</td> <td> <div>$0</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\">Expedited Delivery and Special Postal Services<br> <em>fees are per address</em></th> </tr> <tr> <td>FedEx Standard Overnight (48 states only — not available to AK or HI)</td> <td> <div>$20</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>FedEx — Bill to Your Account Number<br> <em>you must provide a completed airbill </em></p> </td> <td> <div>$0</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td>USPS Express Mail (domestic)</td> <td> <div>$30</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td>USPS Global Express Mail (international)</td> <td> <div>$40</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td>USPS Priority Mail</td> <td> <div>$9</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td>USPS Certified Mail</td> <td> <div>$7</div> </td> </tr> </tbody>\n</table> <p><span>The Office of the Registrar will waive the $15 fee for official transcripts sent to scholarship-granting agencies for students who are scholarship recipients when the scholarship-granting agency requires students to provide a transcript to demonstrate satisfactory academic progress. Students must provide documentation of the scholarship-granting agency's transcript requirement. The Office of the Registrar will not waive the transcript fee for students applying to scholarships.</span></p>\n</div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Transcripts</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/ordering-transcripts\">Ordering Transcripts</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcripts-fees\" aria-current=\"page\">Fees for Transcripts</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcript-request-forms\">Transcript Request Form</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcript-pickup\">PDF Transcript Pickup</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcript-guide-and-grading-key\">Transcript Guide and Grading Key</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/catalogarchives\">Course Catalog Archives</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
