      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Transcript Request Form Students and recent alumni who have a MyAccess login can order official transcripts online. Simply log in to the student portal and click the \"Study List & Grades\" tab",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Transcript Request Form</h1><p>Students and recent alumni who have a <a href=\"http://myaccess.ucsf.edu\">MyAccess</a> login can order official transcripts online.&nbsp;Simply log in to the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\">student portal</a> and click the \"Study List &amp; Grades\" tab. Former students should <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b1c3d4d6d8c2c5c3d0c3f1c4d2c2d79fd4d5c48ec2c4d3dbd4d2c58ce1dec3c5d0dd948381f0d2d2d4c2c29483819c948381f7dec3dcd4c3948381e2c5c4d5d4dfc5\">e-mail</a> the Office of the Registrar for assistance in logging in to the student portal.</p><p>If you cannot order a transcript online, you may submit a paper Transcript Request Form.&nbsp;Download a paper Transcript Request Form based on how you intend to submit the form to the Office of the Registrar:</p><p>Submit Transcript Request Form by <a href=\"/document/transcript-request-form-email\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"transcript_request_form_email\">e-mail</a></p><p>Submit Transcript Request Form by <a href=\"/document/transcript-request-form-fax-pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"transcript_request_form_fax.pdf\">fax or U.S. Mail</a></p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Transcripts</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/ordering-transcripts\">Ordering Transcripts</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcripts-fees\">Fees for Transcripts</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcript-request-forms\" aria-current=\"page\">Transcript Request Form</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcript-pickup\">PDF Transcript Pickup</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/transcript-guide-and-grading-key\">Transcript Guide and Grading Key</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/transcripts/catalogarchives\">Course Catalog Archives</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
