      "summary": "Course Catalog Archives This site is a repository for UCSF's Course Catalog archives. If a course catalog you require is not available below, please contact Associate Registrar Christian Sweatt ",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Course Catalog Archives</h1><p>This site is a repository for UCSF's Course Catalog archives. If a course catalog you require is not available below, please contact Associate Registrar <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#76151e041f05021f171858050113170202360315051058131203490503141c1315024b351903040513534446351702171a19115344463704151e1f001305\">Christian Sweatt</a>. If you need assistance accessing any of these documents, please contact the <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#96e4f3f1ffe5e2e4f7e4d6e3f5e5f0b8f3f2e3a9e5e3f4fcf3f5e2abd5f9e3e4e5f3b3a4a6d5f7e2f7faf9f1b3a4a6d7e4f5feffe0f3e5\">Office of the Registrar</a>.</p><h2>1970s</h2><p><a href=\"/media/226\" title=\"1973-74UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1973-74</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only<br><a href=\"/document/1976-77\" title=\"1976-77\">1976-77</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only<br><a href=\"/document/1977-78ucsf-gen-catreadable-pdf\" title=\"1977-78UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1977-78</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only<br><a href=\"/media/241\" title=\"1978-79UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1978-79</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only<br><a href=\"/document/1979-80ucsf-gen-catreadable-pdf\" title=\"1979-80UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1979-80</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only</p><h2>1980s</h2><p><a href=\"/media/251\" title=\"1980-81UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1980-81</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only<br><a href=\"/media/256\" title=\"1981-82UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1981-82</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only<br><a href=\"/media/261\" title=\"1982-83UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1982-83</a> UCSF General Catalog, Course Descriptions Only<br><a href=\"/media/266\" title=\"1983-84UCSF.Gen.Catreadable.pdf\">1983-84</a> 