      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/diplomas/diploma-overview",
      "path": "/diplomas/diploma-overview",
      "slug": "diplomas-diploma-overview",
      "title": "Diploma Overview",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Diploma Overview Diplomas & Certificates The Office of the Registrar will use the student's legal name on their diploma. To change your legal name in university records, please submit a Petition for Name Change to the Office of the Registra",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Diploma Overview</h1><h2>Diplomas &amp; Certificates</h2><p>The Office of the Registrar will use the student's legal name on their diploma.</p><p>To change your legal name in university records, please submit a <a href=\"/document/441-pdf\" title=\"441.pdf\">Petition for Name Change</a> to the Office of the Registrar at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6a180f0d03191e180b182a1f09190c440f0e1f55191f08000f091e57240b070f4f585a29020b040d0f\"><span>[email&#160;protected]</span></a> during the first two weeks of your final quarter of enrollment.</p><p>If you have already graduated, submit a <a href=\"/document/petition-for-name-change-after-graduation-pdf\" title=\"petition_for_name_change_after_graduation.pdf\">Petition for Name Change After Graduation</a> and review procedures for <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-or-certificate-reissue\" title=\"Diploma or Certificate Reissue\">having your diploma reissued</a>.</p><h2>Diploma &amp; Certificate Sizes</h2><p>Doctor of Dental Surgery, Doctor of Medicine, Doctor of Nursing Practice, Doctor of Pharmacy, and Doctor of Physical Therapy diplomas: 11\" X 17\"</p><p>All other diplomas and certificates: 8.5\" X 11\"</p><h2>Read more</h2><p><a href=\"/students/diplomas/how-obtain-your-diploma\">How to obtain your diploma.</a></p><p><a href=\"/students/diplomas/diploma-or-certificate-reissue\">How to get a reissue of your diploma.</a></p><p><a href=\"/students/diplomas/diploma-certification-boards\">How to get your diploma certified for the boards.</a></p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Diplomas</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-overview\" aria-current=\"page\">Diploma Overview</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/how-obtain-your-diploma\">How To Obtain Your Diploma</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-or-certificate-reissue\">Diploma or Certificate Reissue</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-certification-boards\">Diploma Certification for the Boards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-mailing-request-form\">Diploma Mailing Request Form</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/access-electronic-systems-after-graduation\">Access to Electronic Systems After Graduation</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
