      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Access to Electronic Systems After Graduation</h1> <p>Students who graduate may lose access to some electronic services at UCSF. Please <a href=\"/access-electronic-systems-when-not-registered\">read more</a>.</p>\n</div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Diplomas</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-overview\">Diploma Overview</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/how-obtain-your-diploma\">How To Obtain Your Diploma</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-or-certificate-reissue\">Diploma or Certificate Reissue</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-certification-boards\">Diploma Certification for the Boards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/diploma-mailing-request-form\">Diploma Mailing Request Form</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/diplomas/access-electronic-systems-after-graduation\" aria-current=\"page\">Access to Electronic Systems After Graduation</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
