    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/verifications/alumni",
      "path": "/verifications/alumni",
      "slug": "verifications-alumni",
      "title": "Alumni and Former Students",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Alumni and Former Students The University of California, San Francisco (OPE ID: 001319 ) has authorized the National Student Clearinghouse to act as our agent for all verifications of earned degrees and student enrollment. Employers or auth",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Alumni and Former Students</h1><p>The University of California, San Francisco (OPE ID: <strong>001319</strong>)&nbsp;has authorized the National Student Clearinghouse to act as our agent for all verifications of earned degrees and student enrollment. Employers or authorized third parties should visit <a href=\"https://www.degreeverify.org\">www.degreeverify.org</a> or contact the National Student Clearinghouse at 2300 Dulles Station Blvd Ste 220, Herndon VA 20171. Graduates tasked with providing a degree verification should <a href=\"https://registrar.ucsf.edu/transcripts/ordering-transcripts\">order an official transcript</a>.</p><p>The Office of the Registrar may decline to verify degrees of students who have not paid all fees due to the university.</p><p>UCSF is a graduate-level health-sciences campus. We offer professional degree programs in medicine, dentistry, pharmacy, and nursing, as well as graduate academic programs.</p><p>Some commonly requested verifications that cannot be fulfilled by this office are:</p><p><a href=\"/verifications/residency\">Postdoctoral, Internship &amp; Residency Programs</a></p><h2>School of Nursing</h2><h3>Employers:</h3><p>Please contact The National Student Clearinghouse to verify degrees and certificates.&nbsp;If, after seeking a verification from the National Student Clearinghouse (see above), additional elements of a graduate's record require verification, please email <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1143747678626563706351647262773f747564\" title=\"Registrar@ucsf.edu\"><span>[email&#160;protected]</span></a>&nbsp;for guidance. &nbsp;</p><h3>Graduates:</h3><p>Post Masters graduates prior to Fall 2019:&nbsp;Please email the School of Nursing, at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9bc8d4d5c4deffcdfee9f2fdf2f8faeff2f4f5e8dbeef8e8fdb5feffee\" title=\"SON_EdVerifications@ucsf.edu\"><span>[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</p><p>Individuals requiring:<br><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; An out of state (not CA) licensure form completed;</em><br><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; CGFNS/ NNAS certification requests;</em><br><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Confirmation of a specialty (for MS graduates prior to the fall 2013 term);</em><br><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Confirmation of MEPN certification;</em></p><p>Please email&nbsp;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#326057555b414640534072475141541c575647\" title=\"Registrar@ucsf.edu\"><span>[email&#160;protected]</span></a>&nbsp;for guidance. For most situations, you will be asked to order a transcript and submit any required forms along with your Transcript Request Form. The Office of the Registrar will forward the transcript and any accompanying forms to the School of Nursing.</p><h2>UC Berkeley Extension</h2><p>If the verification or transcript request is for UC Extension courses taken in the 1980s and 1990s, please contact <a href=\"https://extension.berkeley.edu/static/studentservices/transcripts/\" target=\"_blank\">UC Berkeley Extension</a>.</p><h2>UC Law San Francisco</h2><p>Please contact <a href=\"http://www.uchastings.edu/about/admin-offices/records/transcripts/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">UC Law San Francisco</a> for verifications or transcripts from UC Law San Francisco.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Verifications</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/current-students\">Current Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/alumni\" aria-current=\"page\">Alumni and Former Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/residency\">Postdoctoral, Internship &amp; Residency Programs</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/employment-verification\">Employment Verification</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
