      "summary": "Employment Verification To verify a person's employment at UCSF, including student employment, visit the Verification of Employment site . Verifications Current Students Alumni and Former Students Postdoctoral, Internship & Residency Progra",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Employment Verification</h1> <p>To verify a person's employment at UCSF, including student employment, visit the <a href=\"https://controller.ucsf.edu/how-to-guides/payroll/verification-employment-income\" target=\"_blank\">Verification of Employment site</a>.</p>\n</div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Verifications</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/current-students\">Current Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/alumni\">Alumni and Former Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/residency\">Postdoctoral, Internship &amp; Residency Programs</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/verifications/employment-verification\" aria-current=\"page\">Employment Verification</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
