    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/student-records/examination",
      "path": "/student-records/examination",
      "slug": "student-records-examination",
      "title": "Credit by Examination",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Credit by Examination Subject to the eligibility limits described below, students may fulfill some course requirements through credit by examination. The course instructor tests students and provides a grade on the final grade report",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Credit by Examination</h1><p>Subject to the eligibility limits described below, students may fulfill some course requirements through credit by examination. The course instructor tests students and provides a grade on the final grade report. Students should submit a <a href=\"/document/466-pdf\" media=\"download\" title=\"466.pdf\">Petition for Credit by Examination</a>. Petitions should be filed with the study list. Credit by examination appears on the transcript, and the grade is included in the student’s GPA. A transcript note will indicate that the student received credit by examination.</p><p>Eligibility Notes:</p><ul><li>Graduate academic students are ineligible for credit by examination</li><li>Some schools may limit courses or units to be taken for credit by examination</li><li>Petitions are due with study list or not later than date of study list changes. An add petition is required if the course is not on the study list.</li></ul></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Student Records</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/name-change\">Legal Name Change</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/preferred\">Lived Names</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/substitution\">Petition for Substitution of Course</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/examination\" aria-current=\"page\">Credit by Examination</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/disclosure\">Disclosure of Information - FERPA</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/grades\">Grades</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/dns\">Nursing DNS to PhD Conversion</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/nondisc\">Nondiscrimination Policy Statement</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/alumni-portal-access\">Student Portal Access for Alumni &amp; Former Students</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
