      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Grading Types Provisional Grades I, E, Y, and NP After you complete course requirements, your course’s Instructor of Record will update your provisional grade to a final grade. You do not need to take any action",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Grading Types</h1><h2>Provisional Grades</h2><h3>I, E, Y, and NP</h3><p>After you complete course requirements, your course’s Instructor of Record will update your provisional grade to a final grade. You do not need to take any action. If a delay or urgency arises, you can contact your instructor directly or send a grade request to the instructor from the study list page in the student portal. [Note: For the School of Pharmacy, NP is a final grade.]</p><h2>In-Progress Grades</h2><h3>UP (Unsatisfactory Progress)</h3><p>UP grades (used by the School of Dentistry) remain on a student’s transcript until the course sequence concludes with a final grade.</p><p>UP grades are not changed prior to the conclusion of the course (even if subsequent quarters are graded SP).</p><p>If a student passes the course, all UP grades are automatically converted to SP grades within 24 hours of submission of a passing final grade by the Instructor of Record. If the student does not pass the course, the UP grades remain on the transcript.</p><h3>IP (In Progress)</h3><p>The IP grade is a placeholder grade for courses extending beyond one quarter, and for MD students in longitudinal programs.</p><p>IP grades are converted to final grades after the course sequence concludes with a final grade.</p><h2>Transcript Grades</h2><p>View the <a href=\"/transcripts/transcript-guide-and-grading-key\">grading key</a>.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Student Records</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/name-change\">Legal Name Change</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/student-records/preferred\">Lived Names</a> </li>