    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/faculty-staff/degree-management-system",
      "path": "/faculty-staff/degree-management-system",
      "slug": "faculty-staff-degree-management-system",
      "title": "Degree Management System",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Degree Management System Graduate academic students initiate the graduation process by submitting an Application for Graduation in the student portal after the term in which they wish to graduate has started. Students in professional school",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Degree Management System</h1><p>Graduate academic students initiate the graduation process by submitting an Application for Graduation in the student portal after the term in which they wish to graduate has started. Students in professional schools are not required to apply for graduation.</p><p>For all programs, program administrators review potential degree candidates in the Degree Management System in the new <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/registrarstaffportal\">staff portal</a>.</p><h2>Training</h2><p>A <a href=\"/document/dms-guide-pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"DMS-Guide.pdf\">guide</a> is available for the Application for Graduation and the Degree Management System.</p><h2>2025-26 Degree Conferral Schedule</h2><p>The table below shows the date on which the Office of the Registrar will be able to <em>begin</em> conferring degrees for that term.</p><p>Students and programs should plan accordingly. The degree conferral <strong>date</strong> (shown on transcripts and diplomas) is always the last date of the term as published in the <a href=\"/registration/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a>; however, the office of the Registrar can begin conferring degrees as of the dates below, which align with UCOP and National Student Clearinghouse reporting deadlines.</p><p>For any questions regarding degree conferral, please reach out to associate registrar <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ceada6bca7bdbaa7afa0e0bdb9abafbaba8ebbadbda8e0abaabbf1bdbbaca4abadbaf38aaba9bcababebfcfe83afa0afa9aba3aba0baebfcfe9db7bdbaaba3ebfc888da1a0a8abbcbcafa2ebfcfe87a0bfbba7bcb7e8afa3bef5aca1aab7f386a7ebfcfe8da6bca7bdbaa7afa0ebfc8d\">Christian Sweatt</a>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>TERM</th><th>BEGIN CONFERRING</th><th>CONFERRAL DATE</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Summer 25 - all</td><td>September 8, 2025</td><td>September 10, 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Fall 25 - all</td><td>December 19, 2025</td><td>December 31, 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Winter 26 - non-MD</td><td>March 23, 2026</td><td>March 29, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Winter 26 - MD</td><td>March 23, 2026</td><td>March 29, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Spring 26 - Pharmacy</td><td>May 15, 2026</td><td>May 15, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Spring 26 - MD</td><td>May 28, 2026</td><td>May 29, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Spring 26 - non-MD</td><td>June 8, 2026</td><td>June 14, 2026</td></tr></tbody></table></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Faculty &amp; Staff</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/faculty-portal-grading\">Faculty Portal &amp; Grading</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/scheduling\">Classroom &amp; Event Scheduling</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/course-evaluations\">Course Evaluations</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/course-review\">Course Review System</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/degree-management-system\" aria-current=\"page\">Degree Management System</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/ferpa-privacy\">FERPA &amp; Privacy</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/ucsf-general-catalog\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/student-information-system\">Student Information System</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
