    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/faculty-staff/ferpa-privacy",
      "path": "/faculty-staff/ferpa-privacy",
      "slug": "faculty-staff-ferpa-privacy",
      "title": "FERPA & Privacy",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "FERPA & Privacy The Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act (FERPA) and UC Policies Applying to the Disclosure of Information from Student Records restrict the disclosure of information from student records.  The Office of the Registrar p",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>FERPA &amp; Privacy</h1><p>The Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act (FERPA) and UC <a href=\"https://policy.ucop.edu/doc/2710533\" target=\"_blank\">Policies Applying to the Disclosure of Information from Student Records</a> restrict the disclosure of information from student records.&nbsp;</p><p>The Office of the Registrar provides a summary of the <a href=\"/document/ferpa-key-concepts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FERPA Key Concepts\">key concepts</a> that faculty and staff should know about privacy of student records.&nbsp;This <a href=\"/media/481\" title=\"FERPA_training_handout.pdf\">training handout</a> provides additional details.</p><p>A <a href=\"/sample-disclosure-consent-form\">sample form</a> is available for students to consent to disclosure of information from their student records.</p><p>FERPA training is available online at the <a href=\"https://tiny.ucsf.edu/FERPA\" target=\"_blank\">UC Learning Center</a>.</p><p><a href=\"http://lecture.ucsf.edu/ETS/Play/34e52813cf61439f922bcbe45ab620841d\" target=\"_blank\">Watch</a> a recording of the Office of the Registrar's FERPA training session on January 17, 2013.</p><p>For further information, the Office of the President has prepared a useful guide to FERPA called <a href=\"https://www.ucop.edu/uc-legal/_files/ed-affairs/ferpa101.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">FERPA 101</a>.</p><p>Please <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#680c071d0f460b091a041b0706281d0b1b0e460d0c1d571b1d0a020d0b1c552e2d3a38294d5a2e381a011e090b114d5a58391d0d1b1c010706\">contact</a> the Office of the Registrar if you have questions about FERPA or privacy of student records.</p><p><a href=\"/student-records/disclosure\">Additional information</a> is available about FERPA.&nbsp;A campus process exists to review student <a href=\"/student-privacy-complaint-process\">complaints</a>.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Faculty &amp; Staff</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/faculty-portal-grading\">Faculty Portal &amp; Grading</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/scheduling\">Classroom &amp; Event Scheduling</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/course-evaluations\">Course Evaluations</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/course-review\">Course Review System</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/degree-management-system\">Degree Management System</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/ferpa-privacy\" aria-current=\"page\">FERPA &amp; Privacy</a> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/ferpa-privacy/sample-consent\">Sample Disclosure Consent Form</a> </li> </ul> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/ucsf-general-catalog\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/faculty-staff/student-information-system\">Student Information System</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
