      "summary": "Registration & Course Enrollment Please review our How to Register page for an overview of the registration process. The How to Register page provides the information you need to know for registration each quarter, including paying fees and",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Registration &amp; Course Enrollment</h1> <p>Please review our <a href=\"/how-register\">How to Register</a> page for an overview of the registration process.&nbsp;The <a href=\"/how-register\">How to Register</a> page provides the information you need to know for registration each quarter, including <a href=\"/paying-fees\">paying fees</a> and course enrollment (<a href=\"/study-list-filing\">study list filing</a>).</p> <h2>Statement of Legal Residence</h2> <p>Please submit your Statement of Legal Residence online in the student portal.&nbsp;Your Statement of Legal Residence registration hold will be released after you complete this requirement.</p> <p><strong>Exception</strong>:&nbsp;Students admitted to Advanced Training in Clinical Research, Doctor of Nursing Practice, Nursing Supplemental Advanced Practice - Distance, Nursing Supplemental Advanced Practice, Healthcare Administration and Interprofessional Leadership, International Dentistry, Biomedical Imaging, Post-Baccalaureate programs, Genetic Counselling, and Global Health master's programs do not need to submit a Statement of&nbsp;Legal Residence.</p> <h2>Contact Information</h2> <p>The Office of the Registrar welcomes your questions. Please <a href=\"/office-hours-location\">contact us</a>.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>New Students</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/new-students-landing\">Overview &amp; Welcome</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studentportal\">Student Portal</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/registration\" aria-current=\"page\">Registration &amp; Course Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/general-catalog\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/financial-aid\">Financial Aid</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/its\">Information Technology (IT)</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/food\">Basic Needs for Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/housing\">Housing Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studenthealth\">Student Mental Health &amp; Wellbeing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/immunization\">Pre-Entrance Health Requirements</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/shipwaiver\">UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/student-disability-services\">Student Disability Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/first-gen\">First Generation Support Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/guardian\">Guardian Scholars Program</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/weid\">Photo ID Card</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/warnme\">WarnMe Emergency Notifications</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/library\">Library</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/success\">Student Success Center</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/clery-act\">Clery Act</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/tobacco-free-policies\">Tobacco Free Policies</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/useful-links\">Useful Links</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
