      "slug": "new-students-food",
      "title": "Basic Needs for Students",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Basic Needs for Students UCSF Basic Needs for Students supports students with the essential resources to thrive here at UCSF. These resources include: Finance & budget Accessibility Health & wellness Food Housing Transportation Dependent ca",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Basic Needs for Students</h1> <p>UCSF Basic Needs for Students supports students with the essential resources to thrive here at UCSF. These resources include:</p> <ul> <li>Finance &amp; budget</li> <li>Accessibility</li> <li>Health &amp; wellness</li> <li>Food</li> <li>Housing</li> <li>Transportation</li> <li>Dependent care</li>\n</ul> <p>Through a robust model of prevention, intervention, and emergency relief, Basic Needs connects students to critical on- and off-campus resources and provides educational opportunities for students to take personal responsibility for their wellness.</p> <p>Please visit <a href=\"https://basicneeds.ucsf.edu/\">basicneeds.ucsf.edu</a> or send e-mail to <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#096b687a606a676c6c6d7a497c6a7a6f276c6d7c\"><span>[email&#160;protected]</span></a> for more information and to access these resources.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>New Students</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/new-students-landing\">Overview &amp; Welcome</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studentportal\">Student Portal</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/registration\">Registration &amp; Course Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/general-catalog\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/financial-aid\">Financial Aid</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/its\">Information Technology (IT)</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/food\" aria-current=\"page\">Basic Needs for Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/housing\">Housing Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studenthealth\">Student Mental Health &amp; Wellbeing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/immunization\">Pre-Entrance Health Requirements</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/shipwaiver\">UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/student-disability-services\">Student Disability Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/first-gen\">First Generation Support Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/guardian\">Guardian Scholars Program</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/weid\">Photo ID Card</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/warnme\">WarnMe Emergency Notifications</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/library\">Library</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/success\">Student Success Center</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/clery-act\">Clery Act</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/tobacco-free-policies\">Tobacco Free Policies</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/useful-links\">Useful Links</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
