      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/new-students/shipwaiver",
      "path": "/new-students/shipwaiver",
      "slug": "new-students-shipwaiver",
      "title": "UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver",
      "pageTitle": "UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver",
      "summary": "UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver As a non-academic condition of enrollment, all graduate and professional students at UC San Francisco are required to maintain continuous health insurance coverage under an approved plan for the durat",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>\n</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1><strong>UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver</strong></h1><p>As a non-academic condition of enrollment, all graduate and professional students at UC San Francisco are required to maintain continuous health insurance coverage under an approved plan for the duration of their enrollment.</p><p>Students are automatically enrolled in the UC Student Health Insurance Plan (UC SHIP). If you have your own health insurance and would prefer to use it, you may apply for a waiver.</p><p>To be eligible for a waiver, your plan must meet the University’s minimum benefit requirements. Waiver approval is granted only when all requirements are fully satisfied. Once approved, you may opt out of UC SHIP.</p><p>Please visit the <a href=\"https://studentmentalhealth.ucsf.edu/insurance/insurance-waiver\" target=\"_blank\">Student Health Insurance Waiver</a> page to review the waiver eligibility criteria, program-specific deadlines, and step-by-step instructions for submitting your application.</p></div> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>New Students</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/new-students-landing\">Overview &amp; Welcome</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studentportal\">Student Portal</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/registration\">Registration &amp; Course Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/general-catalog\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/financial-aid\">Financial Aid</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/its\">Information Technology (IT)</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/food\">Basic Needs for Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/housing\">Housing Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studenthealth\">Student Mental Health &amp; Wellbeing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/immunization\">Pre-Entrance Health Requirements</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/shipwaiver\" aria-current=\"page\">UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/student-disability-services\">Student Disability Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/first-gen\">First Generation Support Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/guardian\">Guardian Scholars Program</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/weid\">Photo ID Card</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/warnme\">WarnMe Emergency Notifications</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/library\">Library</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/success\">Student Success Center</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/clery-act\">Clery Act</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/tobacco-free-policies\">Tobacco Free Policies</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/useful-links\">Useful Links</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
