      "title": "WarnMe Emergency Notifications",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "WarnMe Emergency Notifications WarnMe is UCSF’s official emergency alert system. WarnMe is activated via text, e-mail, and/or phone when there are impacts to operations or an immediate threat to safety or health affecting the campus communi",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>WarnMe Emergency Notifications</h1>\n<div height=\"138\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/g/files/tkssra11031/files/styles/cke_media_resize_small/public/warnme.png.webp?itok=R3ckBcMV\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Warn Me Sign Up\" title=\"Warn Me\"> </div> <p><a href=\"https://beready.ucsf.edu/content/warnme\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://beready.ucsf.edu/content/warnme\">WarnMe</a> is UCSF’s official emergency alert system. WarnMe is activated via text, e-mail, and/or phone when there are impacts to operations or an immediate threat&nbsp;to safety or health affecting the campus community. Please take a moment to add or update your contact numbers of choice in the <a href=\"https://directory.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://directory.ucsf.edu/\">UCSF Directory</a>.</p><h3>To ensure you receive WarnMe alerts</h3><ol><li>Add or update your contact numbers of choice in the <a href=\"https://directory.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">UCSF Directory</a>.</li><li>Click the “Edit My Record” and log in to <a href=\"https://myaccess.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">MyAccess</a>.</li><li>For more information on updating your Directory Contact Record, please visit <a href=\"https://it.ucsf.edu/how-to/directory-services\" target=\"_blank\">Directory Services</a> (must be logged in to UCSF <a href=\"https://myaccess.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">MyAccess</a> to view).</li></ol><p>For more information, please visit <a href=\"https://beready.ucsf.edu/content/warnme\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://beready.ucsf.edu/content/warnme\">https://beready.ucsf.edu/content/warnme</a>.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>New Students</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/new-students-landing\">Overview &amp; Welcome</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studentportal\">Student Portal</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/registration\">Registration &amp; Course Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/general-catalog\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/financial-aid\">Financial Aid</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/its\">Information Technology (IT)</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/food\">Basic Needs for Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/housing\">Housing Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studenthealth\">Student Mental Health &amp; Wellbeing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/immunization\">Pre-Entrance Health Requirements</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/shipwaiver\">UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/student-disability-services\">Student Disability Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/first-gen\">First Generation Support Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/guardian\">Guardian Scholars Program</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/weid\">Photo ID Card</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/warnme\" aria-current=\"page\">WarnMe Emergency Notifications</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/library\">Library</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/success\">Student Success Center</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/clery-act\">Clery Act</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/tobacco-free-policies\">Tobacco Free Policies</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/useful-links\">Useful Links</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General C