      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Student Success Center The Student Success Center, managed by Student Life, collaborates with campus partners to provide academic, personal, and professional resources for UCSF students. Location: Millberry Union West, Room 100 Hours: In Pe",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Student Success Center</h1><p>The Student Success Center, managed by Student Life, collaborates with campus partners to provide academic, personal, and professional resources for UCSF students.</p><h2>Location:</h2><p>Millberry Union West, Room 100</p><h2>Hours:</h2><h3><strong>In Person</strong></h3><p>Monday<span>–</span>Friday: 8 a.m.<span>–</span>5 p.m.<br><br>Virtual appointments available</p><h2>Contact:</h2><p><a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6c1f190f0f091f1f2c190f1f0a42090819531f190e06090f18513d19091f18050302495e5c2a1e0301495e5c3e090b051f181e0d1e495e5c22091b495e5c3f181908090218495e5c3b090e495e5c3f051809\"><span>[email&#160;protected]</span></a> or 415-502-1484</p><p>The Success Center brings together a central location of a wide range of student services:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://basicneeds.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">Basic Needs for Students</a></li><li><a href=\"https://firstgen.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">First Generation Support Services</a></li><li><a href=\"https://studentlife.ucsf.edu/guardianscholars\" target=\"_blank\">Guardian Scholars Program</a></li><li><a href=\"https://learn.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">Learning Resource Services</a></li><li><a href=\"https://studentlife.ucsf.edu/involvement#Registered-Campus-Organizations-Student-Organizations\" target=\"_blank\">Registered Campus Organizations</a></li><li><a href=\"https://sds.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">Student Disability Services</a></li><li><a href=\"https://studentlife.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">Student Life</a></li><li><a href=\"https://gpsa.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Government</a></li><li><a href=\"https://studentlife.ucsf.edu/policies\" target=\"_blank\">Student Rights and Responsibilities</a></li><li><a href=\"https://synapse.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Synapse</em>, UCSF student voices</a></li><li><a href=\"https://veterans.ucsf.edu\" target=\"_blank\">Student Veterans and Military Support Services</a></li></ul><p>The&nbsp;<a href=\"http://success.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Success Center</a>&nbsp;helps UCSF students connect to campus partners and orient students successfully to campus and the Bay Area with insider tips, consolidated services, and one-stop information on how things work.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>New Students</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/new-students-landing\">Overview &amp; Welcome</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studentportal\">Student Portal</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/registration\">Registration &amp; Course Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/general-catalog\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/financial-aid\">Financial Aid</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/its\">Information Technology (IT)</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/food\">Basic Needs for Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/housing\">Housing Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studenthealth\">Student Mental Health &amp; Wellbeing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/immunization\">Pre-Entrance Health Requirements</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/shipwaiver\">UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/student-disability-services\">Student Disability Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/first-gen\">First Generation Support Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/guardian\">Guardian Scholars Program</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/weid\">Photo ID Card</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/warnme\">WarnMe Emergency Notifications</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/library\">Library</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/success\" aria-current=\"page\">Student Success Center</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/clery-act\">Clery Act</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/tobacco-free-policies\">Tobacco Free Policies</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/useful-links\">Useful Links</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
