og\">General Catalog</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/financial-aid\">Financial Aid</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/its\">Information Technology (IT)</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/food\">Basic Needs for Students</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/housing\">Housing Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/studenthealth\">Student Mental Health &amp; Wellbeing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/immunization\">Pre-Entrance Health Requirements</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/shipwaiver\">UC Student Health Insurance Plan Waiver</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/student-disability-services\">Student Disability Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/first-gen\">First Generation Support Services</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/guardian\">Guardian Scholars Program</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/weid\">Photo ID Card</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/warnme\">WarnMe Emergency Notifications</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/library\">Library</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/success\">Student Success Center</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/clery-act\">Clery Act</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/tobacco-free-policies\">Tobacco Free Policies</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/new-students/useful-links\" aria-current=\"page\">Useful Links</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </di