      "summary": "Forms All forms are available at the Office of the Registrar. Forms not listed here may be electronic petitions or processes available in the student portal ",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Forms</h1><p>All forms are available at the Office of the Registrar.</p><p>Forms not listed here may be electronic petitions or processes available in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a>.</p><h2>Forms By Category</h2><h3>California Residency</h3><p><a href=\"/california-residency-new-students\">Statement of Legal Residence for New Students</a><br><a href=\"/document/421-0-pdf\" title=\"421_0.pdf\">Statement of Legal Residence for Continuing Students</a><br><a href=\"/document/416-pdf\" title=\"416.pdf\">Petition for Change of Legal Residence for Continuing Students</a><br><a href=\"/document/california-nrst-exemption-ab540-application-pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"california-nrst-exemption-ab540-application.pdf\">California Nonresident Tuition Exemption Request (AB540)</a></p><h3>Registration</h3><p><a href=\"/student-records/examination\" title=\"Credit by Examination\">Credit by Examination</a><br><a href=\"/registration/intercampus-exchange\" title=\"Intercampus Exchange\">Intercampus Exchange</a><br>Late Study List (add courses online on the \"Study List\" tab in the student portal)<br>Leave of Absence (submit online in the student portal)<br>Name Changes (Must be completed in person at the Office of the Registrar)<br><a href=\"/document/part-time-enrollment\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Part-Time Enrollment\">Part-Time Enrollment</a><br><a href=\"/document/registration-fee-payment-coupon-pdf\" media=\"download\" title=\"registration_fee_payment_coupon.pdf\">Payment Coupon</a><br><a href=\"/document/petition-for-course-sub-0-pdf\" title=\"petition_for_course_sub_0.pdf\">Petition for Substitution of Course</a><br><a href=\"/registration/sf-consortium\" title=\"SF Consortium\">S.F. Consortium</a><br><a href=\"/registration/stanford-exchange\" title=\"Stanford Exchange\">Stanford Exchange</a><br>Study List Change (initiate your request online on the \"Study List\" tab in the student portal)<br><a href=\"/document/summerappl26-pdf\" title=\"summerappl26.pdf\">Summer Session</a><br>Withdrawal Notice (submit online in the student portal)</p><h3>Transcripts &amp; Diplomas</h3><div><a href=\"https://ucsf.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_80QAfEWLpdZw8yG\" target=\"_blank\">Authorization for Third Party Diploma Pickup</a></div><div><a href=\"http://secure.touchnet.net/C20191_ustores/web/store_main.jsp?STOREID=61&amp;clearPreview=true\" target=\"_blank\">Diploma Mailing</a><br><a href=\"/document/petition-for-name-change-after-graduation-pdf\" title=\"petition_for_name_change_after_graduation.pdf\">Name Change After Graduation</a><br><a href=\"/document/reissue-diploma-0-pdf\" title=\"reissue_diploma_0.pdf\">Reissue Lost or Damaged Diploma</a><br><a href=\"/document/transcript-request-form-email\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"transcript_request_form_email\">Transcript Request (submit by e-mail)</a><br><a href=\"/document/transcript-request-form-fax-pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"transcript_request_form_fax.pdf\">Transcript Request (submit by fax or U.S. Mail)</a></div><h3>Graduate Academic Students Only</h3><p><a href=\"https://graduate.ucsf.edu/forms\" target=\"_blank\">Filing Fee</a><br><a href=\"/document/reducedfee-pdf\">Reduced Fee</a></p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div><p>&nbsp;</p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
