      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/registration/deadlines",
      "path": "/registration/deadlines",
      "slug": "registration-deadlines",
      "title": "Deadlines - Summer 2026",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "Deadlines - Summer 2026 Fee Payment Program Session Advanced Training in Clinical Research July 30, 2026 Health Data Science July 30, 2026 Healthcare Administration & Interprofessional Leadership TBD Pharmacy Levels 1, 2 July 30, 2026 ALL O",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>\n</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Deadlines - Summer 2026</h1><table><caption>Fee Payment</caption><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\">Program</th></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\">Session</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Advanced Training in Clinical Research</td><td>July 30, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Health Data Science</td><td>July 30, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Healthcare Administration &amp; Interprofessional Leadership</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>Pharmacy Levels 1, 2</td><td>July 30, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>ALL OTHER PROGRAMS</td><td>July 6, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Summer 1 &amp; Summer Term</td><td>July 6, 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Summer 2</td><td>July 30, 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>Note: Your fee payment deadline appears on the “Summary” tab and “Fees” tab in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Study List Filing</h2><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\">Programs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Healthcare Administration &amp; Interpersonal Leadership</td><td>April 27 ‒ TBD</td></tr><tr><td>All Other Programs</td><td>April 28 ‒ July 31, 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>Note: Check the \"Summary\" tab in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a> for enrollment requirement and deadline.<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Withdraw &amp; Receive Full Refund</h2><p>(please see <a href=\"/registration/refunds\" title=\"Refunds \">Refunds</a>)<br>First day of instruction<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Apply for Reduced Fee Enrollment</h2><p>must apply before paying fees &amp; not later than this deadline:<br>July 2, 2026<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Apply for Filing Fee Status</h2><p>June 15, 2026<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Name Changes</h2><p>July 31, 2026<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Residency Reclassification</h2><p><strong>Effective Fall 2026</strong><br>July 15, 2026<br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Deadlines for future quarters are subject to change. Please check at the start of the quarter to review current deadline information.</strong></p></div> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Registration</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-2026-registration\">Summer 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/spring-2026-registration\">Spring 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/how-register\">How To Register</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/paying-fees\">Paying Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/study-list-filing\">Study List Filing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlines\" aria-current=\"page\">Summer 2026</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlines/fall-2026\">Fall 2026</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlines/winter-2027\">Winter 2027</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlines/spring-2027\">Spring 2027</a> </li> </ul> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/change-study-list\">Changes To Study List</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/residency\">California Residency</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/withdrawal\">Withdrawal &amp; Leave of Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/refunds\">Refunds</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/readmission\">Readmission After Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/id-cards\">ID Cards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/intercampus-exchange\">Intercampus Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/sf-consortium\">SF Consortium</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/stanford-exchange\">Stanford Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/reduced-fee-enrollment\">Reduced Fee Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/part-time-enrollment\">Part-time Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-session-info\">Summer Session Information</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
