    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/ms-hail-registration",
      "path": "/ms-hail-registration",
      "slug": "ms-hail-registration",
      "title": "MS-HAIL Registration",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "MS-HAIL Registration While MS-HAIL registration processes generally follow registration processes for other UCSF students, some important differences exist. Fee Assessment MS-HAIL fees are based on the number of courses in which students en",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>MS-HAIL Registration</h1><p>While MS-HAIL registration processes generally follow registration processes for other UCSF students, some important differences exist.</p><h2>Fee Assessment</h2><p>MS-HAIL fees are based on the number of courses in which students enroll.&nbsp;Students may add and drop courses until the deadline provided on the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a> \"Study List\" tab for enrolling in at least one course.&nbsp;Approximately one day after this deadline, fees will be assessed and displayed in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a>.&nbsp;Students may not add courses after this deadline, and fees will not be adjusted if students drop courses after this deadline.</p><h2>Fee Payment Deadline</h2><p>The payment deadline for MS-HAIL students normally is earlier than the payment deadline for other students.&nbsp;Please check the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a> for your payment deadline.</p><h2>Study List Filing</h2><p>MS-HAIL students must enroll in at least one course by the deadline shown on the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a> \"Study List\" tab.&nbsp;However, MS-HAIL students may not add courses after this deadline.&nbsp;MS-HAIL students can drop courses during the <a href=\"/study-list-filing\">study list change period</a> or by online request after study list filing closes, but fees will not be adjusted if students drop courses after the deadline for enrolling in at least one course.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Registration</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-2026-registration\">Summer 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/spring-2026-registration\">Spring 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/how-register\">How To Register</a> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/how-register/ms-hail\" aria-current=\"page\">MS-HAIL Registration</a> </li> </ul> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/paying-fees\">Paying Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/study-list-filing\">Study List Filing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/change-study-list\">Changes To Study List</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/residency\">California Residency</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/withdrawal\">Withdrawal &amp; Leave of Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/refunds\">Refunds</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/readmission\">Readmission After Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/id-cards\">ID Cards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/intercampus-exchange\">Intercampus Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/sf-consortium\">SF Consortium</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/stanford-exchange\">Stanford Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/reduced-fee-enrollment\">Reduced Fee Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/part-time-enrollment\">Part-time Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-session-info\">Summer Session Information</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\