    {
      "url": "https://registrar.ucsf.edu/registration/fees/ucgpc",
      "path": "/registration/fees/ucgpc",
      "slug": "registration-fees-ucgpc",
      "title": "UCGPC Systemwide Fee",
      "pageTitle": "Office of the Registrar",
      "summary": "UCGPC Systemwide Fee The UCGPC Systemwide Fee funds the UC Graduate and Professional Council .  The fee will be assessed to students automatically, but students can opt out",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>UCGPC Systemwide Fee</h1><p>The UCGPC Systemwide Fee funds the <a href=\"https://www.ucgpc501c3.org/\" target=\"_blank\">UC Graduate and Professional Council</a>.&nbsp; The fee will be assessed to students automatically, but students can opt out.</p><h2>Opting Out</h2><p>Students can visit the Finances / Fees section in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a> to opt out of the fee.&nbsp; The deadline is two weeks prior to the start of instruction listed on the <a href=\"/registration/academic-calendar\">campus academic calendar</a>.&nbsp; Elections to opt out that are made after the deadline will take effect when fees are assessed for the following term.</p><h2>Opting In</h2><p>Students can visit the Finances / Fees section in the <a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">student portal</a> to opt in to pay the fee.&nbsp; The election will take effect immediately for the latest term for which fees have been assessed.&nbsp; Fee calculations will update overnight.</p><h2>Effect of an Election</h2><p>An election to opt out or in will remain in effect unless and until the student changes it.</p><h2>Refunds</h2><p>The deadline to opt out for a particular quarter is two weeks prior to the first day of instruction.&nbsp; Students who cancel their registration, withdraw, or take a leave of absence after the third week of instruction must contact <a href=\"https://www.ucgpc501c3.org/\" target=\"_blank\">UCGPC</a> to request a possible refund.</p><h2>Registration in Absentia</h2><p>Students who register in absentia are not assessed the UCGPC Systemwide Fee.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Registration</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-2026-registration\">Summer 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/spring-2026-registration\">Spring 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/how-register\">How To Register</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/dentistry2025\">School of Dentistry</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/school-of-medicine-2025-26\">School of Medicine</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/nursing2025\">School of Nursing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/pharmacy2025\">School of Pharmacy</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/globalhealth2025\">Global Health Sciences</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/graddiv2025\">Graduate Division</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/summer2025\">Summer Session</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/transitpass\">Student Transit Pass</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/ucgpc\" aria-current=\"page\">UCGPC Systemwide Fee</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees/archived\">Archived Fees</a> </li> </ul> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/paying-fees\">Paying Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/study-list-filing\">Study List Filing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/change-study-list\">Changes To Study List</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/residency\">California Residency</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/withdrawal\">Withdrawal &amp; Leave of Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/refunds\">Refunds</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/readmission\">Readmission After Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/id-cards\">ID Cards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/intercampus-exchange\">Intercampus Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/sf-consortium\">SF Consortium</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/stanford-exchange\">Stanford Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/reduced-fee-enrollment\">Reduced Fee Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/part-time-enrollment\">Part-time Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-session-info\">Summer Session Information</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
