      "summary": "Form 1098-T Information IRS Form 1098-T – Tuition Statement Each January, UCSF produces a Form 1098-T, Tuition Statement, and provides a copy to students and to the Internal Revenue Service. Forms are available by January 31 for the previou",
      "bodyHtml": "<main> <div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-drupal-messages-fallback></div> </div> </div> <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a> <div> <div> <div> <article> <div> <div><h1>Form 1098-T Information</h1><h3>IRS Form 1098-T – Tuition Statement</h3><p>Each January, UCSF produces a Form 1098-T, Tuition Statement, and provides a copy to students and to the Internal Revenue Service. Forms are available by January 31 for the previous tax year.</p><p>UCSF can mail the Form 1098-T.&nbsp;Or students can consent in the student portal to receive their Form 1098-T electronically.&nbsp;Students who consent to receive their Form 1098-T electronically receive an e-mail message in January notifying them that the form is available.&nbsp;They can view the form in the student portal or at UCSF's Form 1098-T vendor's Web site.</p><p>Please read <a href=\"/accessing-your-form-1098-t\">how to access your Form 1098-T</a> for tax year 2025.</p><p>The UCSF Graduate Division provides <a href=\"https://graduate.ucsf.edu/tax-information\" target=\"_blank\">information about taxes</a> that may be particularly useful for graduate academic students.&nbsp;Student Financial Services offers a <a href=\"https://finaid.ucsf.edu/financial-literacy\" target=\"_blank\">financial literacy</a> Web site for professional students.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/about-publication-970\" target=\"_blank\">IRS Publication 970</a>, Tax Benefits for Education, provides useful information as well.</p><p><strong>UC Path Payments</strong></p><p>Important update for Graduate Student Researcher (GSR) fellows and trainees who receive a Form 1098-T for qualified education expenses paid through UCPath: UCPath payments are included in Box 5 of your Form 1098-T.</p><p><strong>Questions and Additional Information</strong></p><p>For details about the amounts reported on your Form 1098-T, refer to the detailed summary starting on page 2 of your Form 1098-T, Tuition Statement.</p><p>If you have questions about the summary pages, please e-mail <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6253525b5a161114010607110922170111044c070617\"><span>[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</p></div> <section> </section> </div> </article> </div> </div>\n<div> <div> <div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <aside> <div> <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-sb-nine-mainmenu-menu\"> <h2><span>Registration</span></h2> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-2026-registration\">Summer 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/spring-2026-registration\">Spring 2026 Registration</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/how-register\">How To Register</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/paying-fees\">Paying Fees</a> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/form-1098-t\" aria-current=\"page\">Form 1098-T Information</a> <ul> <li> <a href=\"/registration/form-1098-t-access\">Accessing Your Form 1098-T</a> </li> </ul> </li> </ul> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/study-list-filing\">Study List Filing</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/change-study-list\">Changes To Study List</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/residency\">California Residency</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/withdrawal\">Withdrawal &amp; Leave of Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/refunds\">Refunds</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/readmission\">Readmission After Absence</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/id-cards\">ID Cards</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/intercampus-exchange\">Intercampus Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/sf-consortium\">SF Consortium</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/stanford-exchange\">Stanford Exchange</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/reduced-fee-enrollment\">Reduced Fee Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/part-time-enrollment\">Part-time Enrollment</a> </li> <li> <a href=\"/registration/summer-session-info\">Summer Session Information</a> </li> </ul> </nav> </div> </aside> <aside> <div> <div> <div> <h2>Quick Links</h2> <div> <div><p><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/studentportal/\" target=\"_blank\">Student Portal Login</a><br><a href=\"/academic-calendar\">Academic Calendar</a><br><a href=\"http://catalog.ucsf.edu/\" target=\"_blank\">General Catalog</a><br><a href=\"https://saa.ucsf.edu/courseschedule/\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule of Classes</a><br><a href=\"/forms\">Forms</a><br><a href=\"/registration/deadlineshome\">Deadlines</a><br><a href=\"/registration/fees\">Fees</a><br><a href=\"/registration/residency\" title=\"California Residency\">California Residency</a></p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </main>",
